      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEATLEY HAYZE (4) was well supported last time and gave a sight after a fast early split but could manage only the minor money, finishing a 1.75 lengths third (19.67) over 352m at this track. Good form should continue. DISCO ETHICS (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 19.97 beating Cambla Bliss. Goes well out of this box with a win and eight minor placings. Deserves serious consideration again. MEGA MOVE (2) finished a 1.3 lengths second last start over 352m at this track in a strong 19.64. Rates a leading chance if runs up to latest. LITTLE HOUSE (7) was below best last time at Q Straight (19.18) in a Grade 3/4, finishing a 1.75 lengths fourth. Has two wins already from this draw.",
